(Northstar Studio Remote Work Handbook) Tj
T*
(Version 1.2, revised March 2025.) Tj
T*
(This handbook explains how the small product team works across time zones.) Tj
T*
(The core collaboration window is 1:00 PM to 4:00 PM UTC on weekdays.) Tj
T*
(Outside that window, teammates should leave clear written handoffs.) Tj
T*
(Use the project tracker for decisions that affect delivery dates.) Tj
T*
ET
