(Meeting and communication guidelines) Tj
T*
(Weekly planning happens every Monday at 2:00 PM UTC and lasts 45 minutes.) Tj
T*
(A meeting needs an agenda before it is scheduled.) Tj
T*
(Use chat for quick questions and the project tracker for durable decisions.) Tj
T*
(The expected response time for non-urgent chat is one business day.) Tj
T*
(Urgent production issues should be marked with the incident label.) Tj
T*
ET
