(Time off and equipment) Tj
T*
(Request planned time off at least ten calendar days before the first day away.) Tj
T*
(For unexpected sick leave, notify your manager as soon as practical.) Tj
T*
(The company reimburses up to 600 US dollars for a home-office setup after approval.) Tj
T*
(Receipts must be submitted within 30 days of purchase.) Tj
T*
(Company laptops are replaced on a four-year cycle unless repair is impractical.) Tj
T*
ET
